// engine sums into the run energy drain, and its energy_restore param, which it sums over WORN
// equipment in calculateRunWeight() and applies in updateEnergy(). Not in
// outfit_effects.rs2 - there is no script.
// energy_restore is 10, where OSRS pays 4. See tools/gracefulspec.json: the set totals
// 50% against OSRS's 30%, by Corey's choice, and the whole 50 is per piece.
